title UC1: Create or fetch Profile on demand (with Multiparty check)

participant "VBC (Logic)" as VBC
participant "Contact BC" as Contact
participant "DPS.Profile" as ProfileAPI

note over VBC: User triggers Insert action on VBC

alt [Profile Id and Multiparty Company Id are EMPTY]
    
    VBC -> ProfileAPI: GET /profile (email=Contact.Email)
    ProfileAPI --> VBC: profile data or None
    
    alt [profile found]
        note over VBC: check if profile contains relatedParties\n(entityReferredType: Customer, role: adminCompany, id: clientId)
        
        alt [relatedParties entity missing]
            note over VBC: add missing relatedParties to profile
            VBC -> ProfileAPI: POST /profile/{profileId}/relatedParties\n(payload: [{entityReferredType: "Customer", role: "adminCompany", id: clientId}])
            ProfileAPI --> VBC: 200 OK / 201 Created
        end
        
        note over VBC: save fetched Profile Id\nand Multiparty Company Id
        VBC -> Contact: update fields on Contact BC
        
    else [profile not found]
        note over VBC: Try to create profile on demand
        VBC -> ProfileAPI: POST /profile
        ProfileAPI --> VBC: profile data (201 Created)
        
        note over VBC: save new Profile Id\nand Multiparty Company Id
        VBC -> Contact: update fields on Contact BC
    end

else [Profile Id is POPULATED, but Multiparty Company Id is EMPTY]
    
    VBC -> ProfileAPI: GET /profile/{profileId}
    ProfileAPI --> VBC: profile data
    
    note over VBC: check if profile contains relatedParties\n(entityReferredType: Customer, role: adminCompany, id: clientId)
    
    alt [relatedParties entity missing]
        note over VBC: add missing relatedParties to profile
        VBC -> ProfileAPI: POST /profile/{profileId}/relatedParties\n(payload: [{entityReferredType: "Customer", role: "adminCompany", id: clientId}])
        ProfileAPI --> VBC: 200 OK / 201 Created
    end
    
    note over VBC: save Multiparty Company Id
    VBC -> Contact: update Multiparty Company Id on Contact BC

else [Both Profile Id and Multiparty Company Id are POPULATED]
    note over VBC: Profile and Company context already exist,\nskip DPS.Profile API calls
end

