title UC2: Insert role(s) or billing profile(s) (Scoped to MultipartyCompany)

actor "User" as User
participant "Applet VBC" as Applet
participant "VBC (Logic)" as VBC
participant "DPS.RnP" as RNP

User -> Applet: trigger add action (Single or Bulk)
Applet -> VBC: Action triggered

note over VBC: check if Profile fields are populated\non Contact BC
alt [Profile fields are EMPTY]
    ref over VBC: UC1: Create or fetch Profile on demand
end

alt [Single Insert (Role or Billing Profile)]
    note over VBC: Single addition (OnePortalRole or technicalRole)
    VBC -> RNP: GET /permissions\n(query: profileId AND multipartyCompanyId)
    RNP --> VBC: list of current permissions for THIS company
    
    alt [role/profile already exists in THIS company]
        note over Applet: show error message:\n"Duplicate - role/profile already exists"
    else [role/profile not found]
        VBC -> RNP: POST /permissions
        RNP --> VBC: permission data (201 Created)
        note over Applet: record added, refresh view
    end

else [Bulk Insert: "Add complete set" (Digital Identity)]
    note over VBC: Add all missing OnePortalRole permissions
    VBC -> RNP: GET /permissions\n(query: profileId AND multipartyCompanyId)
    RNP --> VBC: list of current permissions for THIS company
    
    note over VBC: determine missing roles by comparing\nall available roles with assigned ones
    
    loop [for each missing OnePortalRole]
        VBC -> RNP: POST /permissions\n(payload with OnePortalRole)
        RNP --> VBC: 201 Created
    end
    note over Applet: records added, refresh view

else [Bulk Insert: "Add all" (Billing Profiles)]
    note over VBC: Add all missing billing profiles
    VBC -> VBC: fetch all Billing Profiles associated\nwith Customer Account
    
    VBC -> RNP: GET /permissions\n(query: profileId AND multipartyCompanyId)
    RNP --> VBC: list of current permissions for THIS company
    
    note over VBC: filter out already assigned billing profiles\n(technicalRole on BillingAccount)
    
    loop [for each missing Billing Profile]
        VBC -> RNP: POST /permissions\n(payload with technicalRole)
        RNP --> VBC: 201 Created
    end
    note over Applet: records added, refresh view
end

